/// M07 CORE-048 "bundled wrappers: 13 assert roots green".
/// Source: tests/integration/wrap_test.go symbol TestCurrentBundledWrappers.
/// Related fixture: compiler/testdata/current/wrap/main.can (read at Go
/// L104, URL-retargeted at L108-109, staged pristine as src/main.can at
/// L111; the absorbed-row mutation at L176 applies only to the wrong-key
/// leg, never the green assert leg).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with a passed report carrying
/// exactly 13 roots: 1 load root, 2 cached roots, 3 settled roots, 1
/// report root, 1 assess root, 2 guarded roots, and the probe,
/// via_reference and main sample roots (Go L113-116/L122), grounded per
/// function in main.can.
/// Wrapper policy semantics (recovery paths, error identities, load
/// bypass, wrong-key refusal, strict-ts) live in
/// core-048-wrappers-semantics.can; the TFT production process shape lives
/// in core-048-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); the 404/429-busy/503-broken/
/// success/missing-local-key variants (Go L141-184) and the strict-tsc
/// leg (L186-205) belong to the sibling files.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. CAN_I17_TOKEN is harness-supplied
/// (Go L90/L198-analog: "test-only"), not an external gate. Logical gates
/// SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23/QHTTP/QN1; no
/// live run now. Descriptor timeout 120000ms mirrors the Go 2-minute ctx
/// (L27).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QHTTP/QN1 unmet).
/// Case bundled/wrap-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, load-roots, cached-roots, settled-roots,
/// report-roots, assess-roots, guarded-roots, probe-roots,
/// via-reference-roots, main-roots.
/// Facet map (wrap_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L117-120: status 0 and empty diagnostics or the test fatals);
/// report-passed pins the report leg (L122: passed true); root-count pins
/// the thirteen roots (L122: len assertions is 13; L113-116: load 1 plus
/// cached 2 plus settled 3 plus report 1 plus assess 1 plus guarded 2
/// plus probe 1 plus via_reference 1 plus main 1); fixture-name grounds
/// the pins in the staged fixture (L104: main.can; L111: src/main.can);
/// load-roots pins load (fixture L13 decoded with raw fixtures/load.json,
/// 1 root); cached-roots pins cached (fixture L19 absent plus L21 busy,
/// 2 roots); settled-roots pins settled (fixture L30 gone plus L32 slow
/// plus L34 stalled with raw fixtures/load_timeout.json, 3 roots);
/// report-roots pins report (fixture L54 direct, 1 root); assess-roots
/// pins assess (fixture L79 sample with raw fixtures/assess.json,
/// 1 root); guarded-roots pins guarded (fixture L88 absorbed plus L90
/// missing, 2 roots); probe-roots pins probe (fixture L101 sample,
/// 1 root); via-reference-roots pins via_reference (fixture L113 sample,
/// 1 root); main-roots pins main (fixture L125 sample, 1 root).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
